  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie om kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-study on Womens Economic Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en begr&#xe4;nsad f&#xf6;rstudie f&#xf6;r att utr&#xf6;na m&#xf6;jligheterna av att st&#xf6;dja kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt i Somalia genom handel och privat sektorutveckling. Hypotesen &#xe4;r att inkludera Somalia i ett st&#xf6;rre globalt program som genomf&#xf6;rs av Svenska Handelskammaren och finansieras genom det globala anslaget.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is a limited pre-study to analyse the pre-conditions of supporting womens economic empowerment  in Somali through trade and private sector development. If possible, the hypothesis is to include Somalia into a larger programme covering a number of countries implemented by Chamber Trade Sweden through the Global Allocation.</narrative>
  </description>
